{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Gdleen","Due to spacecraft failure earthlings Ryu with computer robot \"MOS\" landed on self-navigated planet Gdleen. There Ryu meets a cute Euradonian fairy Fana. At that time, the planet was in the midst of a dispute over a Gavana temple. Self proclaimed God Gavana captured Fana for a sacrifice. Would they be able to escape? And what the identity of Gavana?! \n\n\n(Source: Translated from gdleen.hatsune.cc)"],"ja":["ガデュリン",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-7139","ids":{"shikimori":7139,"mal":7139,"anilist":7139,"kodik":"movie-96605"},"kodikIds":["movie-55603","movie-73261","movie-96605"],"kodikRevisions":{"movie-55603":"2020-05-21T03:38:48Z","movie-73261":"2021-05-24T14:52:25Z","movie-96605":"2023-07-19T16:23:35Z"},"title":"Гдлин","originalTitle":"Gdleen","alt":"Гдлин ガデュリン","description":"Из-за неполадки космического корабля землянин Рю и сопровождающий его робот MOS-01 вынуждены совершить аварийную посадку на планете Гдлин. Там Рю знакомится с красивой феей по имени Фана, а вскоре они оказываются в эпицентре противостояния двух воюющих племён.","year":1990,"type":"OVA","genres":["Фэнтези","Фантастика"],"rating":5.65,"popularity":760,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/7139/3bfc44820e27eebfed6c437faf4a2270.jpeg","width":317,"height":450},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/dc0ba82243d7233205a427d99967e64c0e018b98.jpg","width":640,"height":480}},"releasedEpisodes":[1],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-651","dubId":"651","label":"Люб. Многоголосый","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"movie-55603","translationId":"651","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/video/55603/29b2041dc1c02ee3c56b65e9ce00fdd5/720p","season":1,"ordinal":1}},{"